(text "Everything but the tubes: power, the 185 V converter, the Nano, the decoders, the anode switches, the AM/PM\nexpander, the RTC and the backlight. Its seven socket strips (XS) take the display board's pin strips.\nEvery net is named as on the board: HV185 is the 185 V anode rail; GND, +5V and +12V are power symbols."
(exclude_from_sim no)
(at 20.32 30.48 0)
